<title>USA: IES Iowa nuke returns to full power.</title>
<headline>IES Iowa nuke returns to full power.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>IES Utilities' 538 megawatt Duane Arnold nuclear power unit returned to full power, the company earlier predicted, over the weekend, the Nuclear Regulatory Commission (NRC) said in its Monday morning report.</p>
<p>The Palo, Iowa, unit was shut October 11 for scheduled refueling and maintenance.</p>
<p>IES Utilities is a subsidiary of IES Industries Inc.</p>
<p>--H McCulloch, New York Power Desk +212-859-1628</p>
</text>
